  ],
  "prior_outcome_exposure": "exposed",
  "exposure_record": "Originating review received 2026-11-01 authorizes the prospective v2 amendment after committed v1 hold 5e85c6f. V1 released zero accessibility endpoints: all three streams stopped at their first repeated coordinate/barcode key. Six literal offending records showed opposite strands. These source semantics, metadata, paper and Q3a RNA outcomes are exposed. No accessibility contrast was computed before this freeze. Review authorization and exact v1 receipt/validation are hash-bound.",
  "biological_unit": "Deposited library as finite descriptive unit; paired barcodes nested within it. Underlying pooled mouse/preparation independence unknown.",
  "unit_status": "unknown",
  "nesting_and_overlap": "Three libraries CTRL/LGR5/KRT20; LGR5-CTRL and KRT20-CTRL reuse CTRL. Verified identical paired populations across count definitions; RNA is reused across count definitions and region families and labelled as reuse. No independent animal count, cell-derived inference or fitted four-gene correlation.",
  "population_and_selection": "Exact deposited GSE329778 RNA barcodes with positive all-source RNA and canonical nuclear fragment depth; second subset additionally uses unchanged prior RNA-only QC. Zero-coverage and nonallowlisted rows are enumerated; no new ATAC threshold or state call.",
  "contrast": "GSE329778 LGR5 minus CTRL and KRT20 minus CTRL, separately, for Cd74 ENSMUSG00000024610, Tiam1 ENSMUSG00000002489, Cd83 ENSMUSG00000015396 and Ciita ENSMUSG00000022504.",
  "endpoint": "128 fixed paired rows: post-minus-CTRL log2(CPM+1) differences for RNA and locus fragment overlap, plus 64 grouped-minus-record comparison deltas. Primary counts unique strand-labelled source records; sensitivity counts each coordinate/barcode group once. Each definition applies to BOTH its locus numerator and all-canonical-nuclear denominator. readSupport is never a weight. RNA uses all-source RNA counts on identical paired barcodes. Pooled counts/depth or mean barcode CPM, then log transform; raw counts and detection retained. These overlap endpoints differ from ARC peak cut-site counts.",
  "methods": "M33 regions, RNA re-read/QC, exact joins and summary rules remain v1. One full stream per file computes two definitions; validate EOF/CRC, headers, schema, integer/support/strand/barcode fields, contig/start order, and reject repeated chrom/start/end/barcode/strand keys regardless of support. Equal-start groups handle nonadjacent opposite strands. Primary counts both strand-labelled records; alternative groups coordinates/barcode once, for both numerator and denominator. Enumerate opposite-strand groups overall, canonical allowed, excluded, by barcode and locus/region. Reconcile differences and verify identical positive paired sets. Twelve known-answer tests precede freeze; no endpoints until all source attempts finish, no endpoints from invalid partial streams.",
  "missingness_and_exclusions": "All v1 source/mapping/empty-population holds remain except that opposite-strand coordinate/barcode records are explicitly retained under the reviewed primary definition and grouped only in the declared sensitivity. Same-strand duplicates still hold the source. No silent repair, physical-molecule identity claim, liftOver, alias guess or relaxed QC.",
  "multiplicity": "Fixed two count definitions x two contrasts x two paired subsets x two weighting choices x two region families x four loci = 128 paired rows; 64 definition deltas. Retain all eligible cases, no outcome-adaptive definition selection, p-values/FDR/CI, fitted trends or extra loci.",
  "precision_status": "not_applicable",
  "precision_basis": "Finite deposited-library description with unknown independent biological units; no population precision claim or invented effect margin.",
  "validation_scope": "none",
  "design_identifiability": "unknown",
  "inference_scope": "descriptive",
  "interpretation_limit": "GRCm39 public-M33 adaptation, not exact custom-TdTomato or author consensus-peak replay. TSS windows are not experimentally validated promoters; gene-body overlap is a distinct locus proxy. Shared barcodes and nonparallel RNA/fragment signs do not establish within-state effects, causal regulation, TF occupancy, memory or later regeneration. Strand-record and coordinate-group definitions are source-based measurements; neither independently certifies physical molecules. They are not ARC Peaks matrix cut-site counts.",
  "stop_rule": "Source hash or global GTF assembly/version mismatch stops execution. File/locus/subset validation failures become explicit local holds; no dependent endpoint uses an invalid input. Same-population RNA must equal frozen prior counts/denominators and transformed summaries within 1e-10; disagreement stops endpoint release. Preserve all failed/partial artifacts; corrections use a new version. Same-strand duplicate keys or disagreement in count-definition positive paired populations cause a source/global hold respectively. Both denominator differences and locus differences must reconcile with collision diagnostics. RNA contrasts must be identical between definitions.",
